_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103889279175151","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-942","post_id":"942","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103879609717821/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-07-12","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/942/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-732","post_id":"732","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103878724831141","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-07-12","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/732/","text":"Today people across the US are rallying together to save net neutrality.\n \nNet neutrality is the idea that the internet should be free and open for everyone. If a service provider can block you from...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103878724831141","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-731","post_id":"731","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103879822775851","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-07-12","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/731/","text":"I had lunch today with the Norman family on their 2,500 acre cattle ranch in South Dakota. \n\nSeveral years ago at Facebook, our chefs cooked a whole pig. I remember someone saying it would be...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_descr