ravel challenge. It's beautiful here.\n\nOne thing that stood out to us is how different Alaska's social safety net...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103857892105091","text_truncated":false}]